   "Grok is going to become",
   "one of the top three AI",
   "providers in the world.",
   "Right now, they are",
   "working on a new",
   "desktop application",
   "that is going to close",
   "the gap between them",
   "and applications such as",
   "ChatGPT Work",
   "and Claude Cowork.",
   "People will be",
   "able to use the",
   "powerful Grok model",
   "inside of an application",
   "with a nice user interface.",
   "Now, we don't know",
   "when this is set to",
   "release, but given",
   "the amount of work",
   "that's being put into",
   "the Grok models",
   "and their ecosystem,",
   "I believe that it's",
   "going to be in a couple",
   "of weeks or months.",
   "Now follow for more",
   "AI news, videos, and",
   "tutorials each and",
   "every single day,",
   "and catch you",
   "in the next one."
